### Send Order Notification
POST http://localhost:8111/api/notifications/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "amount": 100.50
}

### Send Payment Notification
POST http://localhost:8111/api/notifications/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-001",
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "status": "SUCCESS"
}
